t data for PERSONAL or BUSINESS profiles using a personal API token created from a Wise Business account.\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"payment processing\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":9,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wisepops\",\"name\":\"Wisepops\",\"description\":\"WisePops helps you design smart pop-ups for your website to increase sign-ups and conversions\",\"category\":\"social\",\"categories\":[\"Marketing & social\"],\"originalCategory\":\"marketing\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":5,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wistia\",\"name\":\"Wistia\",\"description\":\"Wistia is a video marketing platform for hosting and managing media, channels, webinars, audience analytics, and account content.\",\"category\":\"lifestyle\",\"categories\":[\"Everyday life\"],\"originalCategory\":\"video & audio\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":10,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wit_ai\",\"name\":\"Wit.ai\",\"description\":\"Wit.ai is a natural language processing platform that enables developers to build applications and devices that understand human language.\",\"category\":\"automation\",\"categories\":[\"AI & automation\"],\"originalCategory\":\"artificial intelligence\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":31,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wix\",\"name\":\"Wix\",\"description\":\"Wix is a cloud-based web development platform that allows users to create HTML5 websites and mobile sites through drag-and-drop tools. The Wix API provides programmatic access to manage sites, products, orders, and other resources.\",\"category\":\"productivity\",\"categories\":[\"Productivity & design\"],\"originalCategory\":\"website builders\",\"authSchemes\":[\"OAUTH2\",\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":144,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wix_mcp\",\"name\":\"Wix MCP\",\"description\":\"Wix is a cloud-based website building platform for creating and managing sites, content, and online business experiences. It supports business features like eCommerce, bookings, blog, and CMS-driven content.\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"e-commerce\",\"authSchemes\":[\"DCR_OAUTH\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":14,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wiza\",\"name\":\"Wiza\",\"description\":\"Wiza helps you find and export accurate contact data for prospects from LinkedIn, providing verified emails, phone numbers, and enriched professional information.\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"sales & crm\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":5,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wolfram_alpha_api\",\"name\":\"Wolfram Alpha Api\",\"description\":\"Integrate computational knowledge into applications via Wolfram|Alpha's APIs.\",\"category\":\"development\",\"categories\":[\"Developer tools\"],\"originalCategory\":\"developer tools\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":11,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"woodpecker_co\",\"name\":\"Woodpecker Co\",\"description\":\"Woodpecker.co is a cold email tool that automates personalized email outreach and follow-ups for sales teams and agencies.\",\"category\":\"communication\",\"categories\":[\"Chat & email\"],\"originalCategory\":\"drip emails\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":8,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"woop_social\",\"name\":\"WoopSocial\",\"description\":\"WoopSocial provides social media publishing, scheduling, media, project, account, and webhook management through its REST API.\",\"category\":\"social\",\"categories\":[\"Marketing & social\"],\"originalCategory\":\"social media marketing\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":20,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"wordpress_com\",\"name\":\"WordPress.com\",\"description\":\"Manage WordPress.com and Jetpack-connected sites, content, media, comments, Reader data, statistics, and supported platform features through the centralized WordPress.com API.\",\"category\":\"knowledge\",\"categories\":[\"Files & knowledge\"],\"originalCategory\":\"content & files\",\"authSchemes\":[\"OAUTH2\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":10,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"workable\",\"name\":\"Workable\",\"description\":\"Workable is an all-in-one HR software platform that streamlines hiring, employee data management, time tracking, and payroll.\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"human resources\",\"authSchemes\":[\"OAUTH2\",\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":37,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"workday\",\"name\":\"Workday\",\"description\":\"Workday is a cloud-based enterprise resource planning (ERP) software that provides comprehensive solutions for human capital management, financial management, and analytics\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"human resources\",\"authSchemes\":[\"OAUTH2\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":567,\"triggerCount\":13},{\"slug\":\"workiom\",\"name\":\"Workiom\",\"description\":\"Workiom allows businesses to create custom workflows, integrate apps, and automate processes, reducing manual overhead and streamlining operations\",\"category\":\"productivity\",\"categories\":[\"Productivity & design\"],\"originalCategory\":\"productivity\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":3,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"workiz\",\"name\":\"Workiz\",\"description\":\"Workiz is a field service management platform for scheduling jobs, managing leads and teams, and recording payments.\",\"category\":\"business\",\"categories\":[\"Business\"],\"originalCategory\":\"crm\",\"authSchemes\":[\"API_KEY\"],\"managedSchemes\":[],\"toolCount\":21,\"triggerCount\":0},{\"slug\":\"worksnaps\",\"name\":\"Worksnaps\",\"descri